        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; PK primary key · FK foreign key · UQ unique index · ? nullable column (all other columns NOT NULL)&lt;br&gt;Each connector runs from exactly one parent to zero or many children. Every child requires its parent. Labels show FK column and delete behavior.&lt;br&gt;HotelAmenities and UsersRoles have composite primary keys. See the next page for check constraints and enum storage." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=14;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1">
